{"id": "draft-c20-01", "category": "解析几何", "sub_category": "二次曲面", "concept": "二次曲面分类与截面", "concept_id": "C20", "parent_training_ids": ["geom-025", "geom-026"], "problem": "指出方程 $z=x^2-y^2$ 表示的二次曲面类型，并分别说明其与平面 $z=0$、$z=1$、$z=-1$ 的交线形状。", "solution": "类型:双曲抛物面(马鞍面)。截面 $z=0$:$x^2-y^2=0$,即 $y=\\pm x$,是两条相交直线。截面 $z=1$:$x^2-y^2=1$,是双曲线(实轴沿 $x$ 方向)。截面 $z=-1$:$y^2-x^2=1$,也是双曲线(实轴沿 $y$ 方向)。", "answer": "双曲抛物面;$z=0$ 截面为两条相交直线 $y=\\pm x$,$z=1$ 与 $z=-1$ 截面为实轴方向不同的双曲线。", "method": "曲面判型+水平截面分析", "difficulty": "基础", "variant_kind": "曲面类型变化:马鞍面的水平截面分支(与椭圆抛物面父题不同)", "scene_spec": {"objects": ["指出方程 $z=x^2-y^2$ 表示的二次曲面类型，并分别说明其与平面 $z=0$、$z=1$、$z=-1$ 的交线形状。", "双曲抛物面;$z=0$ 截面为两条相交直线 $y=\\pm x$,$z=1$ 与 $z=-1$ 截面为实轴方向不同的双曲线。"], "steps": ["第一步:类型:双曲抛物面(马鞍面)。", "第二步:截面 $z=0$:$x^2-y^2=0$,即 $y=\\pm x$,是两条相交直线。", "第三步:截面 $z=1$:$x^2-y^2=1$,是双曲线(实轴沿 $x$ 方向)。", "第四步:截面 $z=-1$:$y^2-x^2=1$,也是双曲线(实轴沿 $y$ 方向)。"]}, "source": "self-authored", "license": "Internal-Research-Use-Only", "draft_status": "CODEX-REPAIR-v4-final-NOT-ADMITTED", "review_status": "CODEX_MATH_REVIEW_COMPLETE_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE", "versioned_id": "codex-repair-v4-final-20261005-batch-11-draft-c20-01", "admitted": false, "animation_render_verified": false, "strict_review": {"core_math_verified": true, "exact_expression_required": true, "rational_numbers": "fractions_or_integers", "text_math_fields_reviewed": true, "scene_text_reviewed": true, "render_verified": false, "admitted": false, "source_batch": "batch-11", "source_sha256": "e0eb9bf14b1cdf0919006ede0e9523046d0edadffb69ac3a10e4941a77563756", "user_review_new_version": "DELEGATED_TO_CODEX_COMPLETED", "math_content_sha256": "326a456e912767882c43921e2d1639cd239ac3989d0bb5d2f378b9639c6b154e", "math_review_evidence": "reviews/codex-supervision/2026-10-05-draft-mail-reverification/selected-math-review-final.json", "verification_basis": "HASH_BOUND_PRIOR_MATH_PLUS_EQUIVALENT_NOTATION_AND_SCENE_REVIEW_EXACT_41_CHECKS"}, "revision_lineage": {"source_sha256": "e0eb9bf14b1cdf0919006ede0e9523046d0edadffb69ac3a10e4941a77563756", "source_path": "reviews/2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts/batch-11/draft.jsonl", "original_id": "draft-c20-01", "prior_parent_training_ids": ["geom-025", "geom-026"], "historical_risk_not_reset": true, "version": "codex-repair-v4-final", "math_correction_notes": "固定水平截面给相交两线与两种轴向双曲线；没有给冻结题全部母线或其系数算法。", "substantive_rewrite": false, "previous_selected_version": {"version": "codex-repair-v3", "path": "reviews/2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts/batch-11/draft-codex-repair-v3.jsonl", "sha256": "37f23ea69c81a0d0c7e15c195d365c71408f4b081e8ae06b2806d1662609e106", "versioned_id": "codex-repair-20261005-batch-11-draft-c20-01"}, "previous_math_review_binding": {"math_content_sha256": null, "evidence": null}}}
{"id": "draft-c20-02", "category": "解析几何", "sub_category": "二次曲面", "concept": "二次曲面分类与截面", "concept_id": "C20", "parent_training_ids": ["geom-025", "geom-026"], "problem": "用配方法判断方程 $x^2+y^2+z^2-2x-4y+1=0$ 表示什么曲面，并求其中心(球心)与半径。", "solution": "配方:$(x^2-2x)+(y^2-4y)+z^2+1=0$,即 $(x-1)^2-1+(y-2)^2-4+z^2+1=0$,整理得 $(x-1)^2+(y-2)^2+z^2=4$。这是球面,球心为 $(1,2,0)$,半径为 $2$。", "answer": "球面,球心 $(1,2,0)$,半径 $2$。", "method": "配方法(平移项判型)", "difficulty": "基础", "variant_kind": "含一次项的配方判型(平移后识别)", "scene_spec": {"objects": ["用配方法判断方程 $x^2+y^2+z^2-2x-4y+1=0$ 表示什么曲面，并求其中心(球心)与半径。", "球面,球心 $(1,2,0)$,半径 $2$。"], "steps": ["第一步:配方:$(x^2-2x)+(y^2-4y)+z^2+1=0$,即 $(x-1)^2-1+(y-2)^2-4+z^2+1=0$,整理得 $(x-1)^2+(y-2)^2+z^2=4$。", "第二步:这是球面,球心为 $(1,2,0)$,半径为 $2$。"]}, "source": "self-authored", "license": "Internal-Research-Use-Only", "draft_status": "CODEX-REPAIR-v4-final-NOT-ADMITTED", "review_status": "CODEX_MATH_REVIEW_COMPLETE_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE", "versioned_id": "codex-repair-v4-final-20261005-batch-11-draft-c20-02", "admitted": false, "animation_render_verified": false, "strict_review": {"core_math_verified": true, "exact_expression_required": true, "rational_numbers": "fractions_or_integers", "text_math_fields_reviewed": true, "scene_text_reviewed": true, "render_verified": false, "admitted": false, "source_batch": "batch-11", "source_sha256": "e0eb9bf14b1cdf0919006ede0e9523046d0edadffb69ac3a10e4941a77563756", "user_review_new_version": "DELEGATED_TO_CODEX_COMPLETED", "math_content_sha256": "4edc19544136ce04e2b2589f696e68ff155edf9a71bd11c7c222bfb45136abf3", "math_review_evidence": "reviews/codex-supervision/2026-10-05-draft-mail-reverification/selected-math-review-final.json", "verification_basis": "HASH_BOUND_PRIOR_MATH_PLUS_EQUIVALENT_NOTATION_AND_SCENE_REVIEW_EXACT_41_CHECKS"}, "revision_lineage": {"source_sha256": "e0eb9bf14b1cdf0919006ede0e9523046d0edadffb69ac3a10e4941a77563756", "source_path": "reviews/2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts/batch-11/draft.jsonl", "original_id": "draft-c20-02", "prior_parent_training_ids": ["geom-025", "geom-026"], "historical_risk_not_reset": true, "version": "codex-repair-v4-final", "math_correction_notes": "配方后右端4，球心(1,2,0)、半径2；不包含冻结球平面或直线交点任务。", "substantive_rewrite": false, "previous_selected_version": {"version": "codex-repair-v3", "path": "reviews/2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts/batch-11/draft-codex-repair-v3.jsonl", "sha256": "37f23ea69c81a0d0c7e15c195d365c71408f4b081e8ae06b2806d1662609e106", "versioned_id": "codex-repair-20261005-batch-11-draft-c20-02"}, "previous_math_review_binding": {"math_content_sha256": null, "evidence": null}}}
{"id": "draft-c20-03", "category": "解析几何", "sub_category": "二次曲面", "concept": "二次曲面分类与截面", "concept_id": "C20", "parent_training_ids": ["geom-025", "geom-026"], "problem": "对曲面$xy+t z^2=1$（$t\\in\\mathbb R$），给出正交坐标替换并分类全部参数，特别说明$t=0$的秩退化。", "solution": "令$u=(x+y)/\\sqrt2$、$v=(-x+y)/\\sqrt2$，则$xy=(u^2-v^2)/2$，方程为$u^2/2-v^2/2+t z^2=1$。若$t>0$，正平方有两个、负平方一个，是单叶双曲面；若$t<0$，正平方一个、负平方两个，是双叶双曲面；若$t=0$，$u^2-v^2=2$与$z$无关，是沿$z$方向的双曲柱面，二次型秩由$3$降为$2$。分类依据惯性与正右端，不凭图像或系数符号猜测。", "answer": "$t>0$单叶，$t<0$双叶，$t=0$双曲柱面；标准坐标方程$u^2/2-v^2/2+tz^2=1$。", "method": "正交标准化与参数秩退化", "difficulty": "中等", "variant_kind": "结构改写：正交标准化与参数秩退化", "scene_spec": {"objects": ["对曲面$xy+t z^2=1$（$t\\in\\mathbb R$），给出正交坐标替换并分类全部参数，特别说明$t=0$的秩退化。", "$t>0$单叶，$t<0$双叶，$t=0$双曲柱面；标准坐标方程$u^2/2-v^2/2+tz^2=1$。"], "steps": ["第一步:令$u=(x+y)/\\sqrt2$、$v=(-x+y)/\\sqrt2$，则$xy=(u^2-v^2)/2$，方程为$u^2/2-v^2/2+t z^2=1$。", "第二步:若$t>0$，正平方有两个、负平方一个，是单叶双曲面；若$t<0$，正平方一个、负平方两个，是双叶双曲面；若$t=0$，$u^2-v^2=2$与$z$无关，是沿$z$方向的双曲柱面，二次型秩由$3$降为$2$。", "第三步:分类依据惯性与正右端，不凭图像或系数符号猜测。"]}, "source": "self-authored", "license": "Internal-Research-Use-Only", "draft_status": "CODEX-REPAIR-v4-final-NOT-ADMITTED", "review_status": "CODEX_MATH_REVIEW_COMPLETE_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE", "versioned_id": "codex-repair-v4-final-20261005-batch-11-draft-c20-03", "admitted": false, "animation_render_verified": false, "strict_review": {"core_math_verified": true, "exact_expression_required": true, "rational_numbers": "fractions_or_integers", "text_math_fields_reviewed": true, "scene_text_reviewed": true, "render_verified": false, "admitted": false, "source_batch": "batch-11", "source_sha256": "e0eb9bf14b1cdf0919006ede0e9523046d0edadffb69ac3a10e4941a77563756", "user_review_new_version": "DELEGATED_TO_CODEX_COMPLETED", "math_content_sha256": "5170ca9519f22255c80b368c3fa3e389cad1208dddae795fbeab9c18986468ea", "math_review_evidence": "reviews/codex-supervision/2026-10-05-draft-mail-reverification/selected-math-review-final.json", "verification_basis": "HASH_BOUND_PRIOR_MATH_PLUS_EQUIVALENT_NOTATION_AND_SCENE_REVIEW_EXACT_41_CHECKS"}, "revision_lineage": {"source_sha256": "e0eb9bf14b1cdf0919006ede0e9523046d0edadffb69ac3a10e4941a77563756", "source_path": "reviews/2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts/batch-11/draft.jsonl", "original_id": "draft-c20-03", "prior_parent_training_ids": ["geom-025", "geom-026"], "historical_risk_not_reset": true, "version": "codex-repair-v4-final", "math_correction_notes": "改为混合项及秩退化参数族，避免固定对角曲面的数值变体。", "substantive_rewrite": true, "previous_selected_version": {"version": "codex-repair-v3", "path": "reviews/2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts/batch-11/draft-codex-repair-v3.jsonl", "sha256": "37f23ea69c81a0d0c7e15c195d365c71408f4b081e8ae06b2806d1662609e106", "versioned_id": "codex-repair-20261005-batch-11-draft-c20-03"}, "previous_math_review_binding": {"math_content_sha256": null, "evidence": null}}}
{"id": "draft-c20-04", "category": "解析几何", "sub_category": "二次曲面", "concept": "二次曲面分类与截面", "concept_id": "C20", "parent_training_ids": ["geom-025", "geom-026"], "problem": "椭球$x^2+2y^2+3z^2=1$与平面$x+y+z=t$相交。求截面中心、全部空集或退化情形，以及非退化截面的精确半轴长。", "solution": "记$W=\\operatorname{diag}(1,2,3)$，$n=(1,1,1)$。在平面上二次型的最小点为$c=tW^{-1}n/(n^{\\mathsf T}W^{-1}n)=(6t/11,3t/11,2t/11)$；$c^{\\mathsf T}Wc=6t^2/11$。写$x=c+h$、$n\\cdot h=0$，交叉项为零，截面满足$h^{\\mathsf T}Wh=1-6t^2/11$。因此$|t|>\\sqrt{11/6}$为空，等号为单点$c$，小于时为椭圆。在切向正交基$e=(1,-1,0)/\\sqrt2$、$f=(1,1,-2)/\\sqrt6$中限制矩阵为$\\begin{pmatrix}3/2&-1/(2\\sqrt3)\\\\-1/(2\\sqrt3)&5/2\\end{pmatrix}$，特征值$2\\pm1/\\sqrt3$。所以长短半轴依次为$\\sqrt{(1-6t^2/11)/(2-1/\\sqrt3)}$、$\\sqrt{(1-6t^2/11)/(2+1/\\sqrt3)}$。", "answer": "中心$(6t,3t,2t)/11$；阈值$|t|=\\sqrt{11/6}$；椭圆半轴$\\sqrt{(1-6t^2/11)/(2\\mp1/\\sqrt3)}$。", "method": "斜截面中心与限制型谱", "difficulty": "中等", "variant_kind": "结构改写：斜截面中心与限制型谱", "scene_spec": {"objects": ["椭球$x^2+2y^2+3z^2=1$与平面$x+y+z=t$相交。求截面中心、全部空集或退化情形，以及非退化截面的精确半轴长。", "中心$(6t,3t,2t)/11$；阈值$|t|=\\sqrt{11/6}$；椭圆半轴$\\sqrt{(1-6t^2/11)/(2\\mp1/\\sqrt3)}$。"], "steps": ["第一步:记$W=\\operatorname{diag}(1,2,3)$，$n=(1,1,1)$。", "第二步:在平面上二次型的最小点为$c=tW^{-1}n/(n^{\\mathsf T}W^{-1}n)=(6t/11,3t/11,2t/11)$；$c^{\\mathsf T}Wc=6t^2/11$。", "第三步:写$x=c+h$、$n\\cdot h=0$，交叉项为零，截面满足$h^{\\mathsf T}Wh=1-6t^2/11$。", "第四步:因此$|t|>\\sqrt{11/6}$为空，等号为单点$c$，小于时为椭圆。", "第五步:在切向正交基$e=(1,-1,0)/\\sqrt2$、$f=(1,1,-2)/\\sqrt6$中限制矩阵为$\\begin{pmatrix}3/2&-1/(2\\sqrt3)\\\\-1/(2\\sqrt3)&5/2\\end{pmatrix}$，特征值$2\\pm1/\\sqrt3$。", "第六步:所以长短半轴依次为$\\sqrt{(1-6t^2/11)/(2-1/\\sqrt3)}$、$\\sqrt{(1-6t^2/11)/(2+1/\\sqrt3)}$。"]}, "source": "self-authored", "license": "Internal-Research-Use-Only", "draft_status": "CODEX-REPAIR-v4-final-NOT-ADMITTED", "review_status": "CODEX_MATH_REVIEW_COMPLETE_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE", "versioned_id": "codex-repair-v4-final-20261005-batch-11-draft-c20-04", "admitted": false, "animation_render_verified": false, "strict_review": {"core_math_verified": true, "exact_expression_required": true, "rational_numbers": "fractions_or_integers", "text_math_fields_reviewed": true, "scene_text_reviewed": true, "render_verified": false, "admitted": false, "source_batch": "batch-11", "source_sha256": "e0eb9bf14b1cdf0919006ede0e9523046d0edadffb69ac3a10e4941a77563756", "user_review_new_version": "DELEGATED_TO_CODEX_COMPLETED", "math_content_sha256": "80aed0c7f1431815eaa0f2c2f86fb889f41be1cb9bddba27383b1e91847fab38", "math_review_evidence": "reviews/codex-supervision/2026-10-05-draft-mail-reverification/selected-math-review-final.json", "verification_basis": "HASH_BOUND_PRIOR_MATH_PLUS_EQUIVALENT_NOTATION_AND_SCENE_REVIEW_EXACT_41_CHECKS"}, "revision_lineage": {"source_sha256": "e0eb9bf14b1cdf0919006ede0e9523046d0edadffb69ac3a10e4941a77563756", "source_path": "reviews/2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts/batch-11/draft.jsonl", "original_id": "draft-c20-04", "prior_parent_training_ids": ["geom-025", "geom-026"], "historical_risk_not_reset": true, "version": "codex-repair-v4-final", "math_correction_notes": "替换留出集同一椭球的坐标截面，改为斜截面限制二次型和切向特征值。", "substantive_rewrite": true, "previous_selected_version": {"version": "codex-repair-v3", "path": "reviews/2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts/batch-11/draft-codex-repair-v3.jsonl", "sha256": "37f23ea69c81a0d0c7e15c195d365c71408f4b081e8ae06b2806d1662609e106", "versioned_id": "codex-repair-20261005-batch-11-draft-c20-04"}, "previous_math_review_binding": {"math_content_sha256": null, "evidence": null}}}
{"id": "draft-c20-05", "category": "解析几何", "sub_category": "二次曲面", "concept": "二次曲面分类与截面", "concept_id": "C20", "parent_training_ids": ["geom-025", "geom-026"], "problem": "用正交变换(旋转)判断方程 $x^2+2xy+y^2+z=0$ 表示的曲面类型。", "solution": "交叉项部分 $x^2+2xy+y^2=(x+y)^2$。作正交变换 $u=\\frac{x+y}{\\sqrt2}$,$v=\\frac{-x+y}{\\sqrt2}$,$w=z$(变换矩阵 $\\begin{pmatrix}\\frac1{\\sqrt2}&\\frac1{\\sqrt2}&0\\\\-\\frac1{\\sqrt2}&\\frac1{\\sqrt2}&0\\\\0&0&1\\end{pmatrix}$ 为正交矩阵且行列式为 $1$,是绕 $z$ 轴的真旋转),则 $x^2+2xy+y^2=2u^2$,方程化为 $2u^2+w=0$,即 $w=-2u^2$。这是母线沿 $v$ 方向的抛物柱面。", "answer": "抛物柱面；新坐标满足$w=-2u^2$，母线沿世界坐标方向$(-1,1,0)/\\sqrt2$。", "method": "正交变换消交叉项", "difficulty": "进阶", "variant_kind": "交叉项处理:正交变换旋转后判型(抛物柱面)", "scene_spec": {"objects": ["用正交变换(旋转)判断方程 $x^2+2xy+y^2+z=0$ 表示的曲面类型。", "抛物柱面；新坐标满足$w=-2u^2$，母线沿世界坐标方向$(-1,1,0)/\\sqrt2$。"], "steps": ["第一步:交叉项部分 $x^2+2xy+y^2=(x+y)^2$。", "第二步:作正交变换 $u=\\frac{x+y}{\\sqrt2}$,$v=\\frac{-x+y}{\\sqrt2}$,$w=z$(变换矩阵 $\\begin{pmatrix}\\frac1{\\sqrt2}&\\frac1{\\sqrt2}&0\\\\-\\frac1{\\sqrt2}&\\frac1{\\sqrt2}&0\\\\0&0&1\\end{pmatrix}$ 为正交矩阵且行列式为 $1$,是绕 $z$ 轴的真旋转),则 $x^2+2xy+y^2=2u^2$,方程化为 $2u^2+w=0$,即 $w=-2u^2$。", "第三步:这是母线沿 $v$ 方向的抛物柱面。"]}, "source": "self-authored", "license": "Internal-Research-Use-Only", "draft_status": "CODEX-REPAIR-v4-final-NOT-ADMITTED", "review_status": "CODEX_MATH_REVIEW_COMPLETE_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE", "versioned_id": "codex-repair-v4-final-20261005-batch-11-draft-c20-05", "admitted": false, "animation_render_verified": false, "strict_review": {"core_math_verified": true, "exact_expression_required": true, "rational_numbers": "fractions_or_integers", "text_math_fields_reviewed": true, "scene_text_reviewed": true, "render_verified": false, "admitted": false, "source_batch": "batch-11", "source_sha256": "e0eb9bf14b1cdf0919006ede0e9523046d0edadffb69ac3a10e4941a77563756", "user_review_new_version": "DELEGATED_TO_CODEX_COMPLETED", "math_content_sha256": "333761b1892e3cd2dff3c4a1aff3cfa39bfa1d942fefb6697990360f474fe846", "math_review_evidence": "reviews/codex-supervision/2026-10-05-draft-mail-reverification/selected-math-review-final.json", "verification_basis": "HASH_BOUND_PRIOR_MATH_PLUS_EQUIVALENT_NOTATION_AND_SCENE_REVIEW_EXACT_41_CHECKS"}, "revision_lineage": {"source_sha256": "e0eb9bf14b1cdf0919006ede0e9523046d0edadffb69ac3a10e4941a77563756", "source_path": "reviews/2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts/batch-11/draft.jsonl", "original_id": "draft-c20-05", "prior_parent_training_ids": ["geom-025", "geom-026"], "historical_risk_not_reset": true, "version": "codex-repair-v4-final", "math_correction_notes": "将新坐标标量与世界坐标的母线方向向量明确分开。", "substantive_rewrite": false, "previous_selected_version": {"version": "codex-repair-v3", "path": "reviews/2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts/batch-11/draft-codex-repair-v3.jsonl", "sha256": "37f23ea69c81a0d0c7e15c195d365c71408f4b081e8ae06b2806d1662609e106", "versioned_id": "codex-repair-20261005-batch-11-draft-c20-05"}, "previous_math_review_binding": {"math_content_sha256": null, "evidence": null}}}
{"id": "draft-c22-01", "category": "解析几何", "sub_category": "二次曲面", "concept": "直纹性与母线", "concept_id": "C22", "parent_training_ids": ["geom-028"], "problem": "验证单叶双曲面 $x^2+y^2-z^2=1$ 是直纹面，并写出其两族直母线。", "solution": "曲面$x^2+y^2-z^2=1$等价于$(x+z)(x-z)=(1+y)(1-y)$。两族直线可完整写成$t(x+z)=s(1+y),\\ s(x-z)=t(1-y)$及$t(x+z)=s(1-y),\\ s(x-z)=t(1+y)$，其中$(s:t)\\in\\mathbb{RP}^1$。若$st\\ne0$，相乘消去$st$得到曲面方程；若$s=0$，两族分别给$x+z=0,y=1$与$x+z=0,y=-1$；若$t=0$，分别给$y=-1,x-z=0$与$y=1,x-z=0$，也全部位于曲面。两平面的法向量在任何非零参数对下独立，故每个成员确为直线。矩阵$\\begin{pmatrix}x+z&1+y\\\\1-y&x-z\\end{pmatrix}$在曲面上秩为$1$且不可能为零；其列空间和行空间分别唯一确定两族参数，故每点各有一条母线。", "answer": "两族母线:$\\begin{cases}x+z=\\lambda(1+y)\\\\ \\lambda(x-z)=1-y\\end{cases}$ 与 $\\begin{cases}x+z=\\mu(1-y)\\\\ \\mu(x-z)=1+y\\end{cases}$($\\lambda,\\mu$ 取扩充实数,含 $\\infty$ 对应极限直线 $y=\\mp1,x=z$);单叶双曲面是直纹面。", "method": "因式分解构造母线族", "difficulty": "基础", "variant_kind": "构造母线:单叶双曲面的两族直母线(因式分解法)", "scene_spec": {"objects": ["验证单叶双曲面 $x^2+y^2-z^2=1$ 是直纹面，并写出其两族直母线。", "两族母线:$\\begin{cases}x+z=\\lambda(1+y)\\\\ \\lambda(x-z)=1-y\\end{cases}$ 与 $\\begin{cases}x+z=\\mu(1-y)\\\\ \\mu(x-z)=1+y\\end{cases}$($\\lambda,\\mu$ 取扩充实数,含 $\\infty$ 对应极限直线 $y=\\mp1,x=z$);单叶双曲面是直纹面。"], "steps": ["第一步:曲面$x^2+y^2-z^2=1$等价于$(x+z)(x-z)=(1+y)(1-y)$。", "第二步:两族直线可完整写成$t(x+z)=s(1+y),\\ s(x-z)=t(1-y)$及$t(x+z)=s(1-y),\\ s(x-z)=t(1+y)$，其中$(s:t)\\in\\mathbb{RP}^1$。", "第三步:若$st\\ne0$，相乘消去$st$得到曲面方程；若$s=0$，两族分别给$x+z=0,y=1$与$x+z=0,y=-1$；若$t=0$，分别给$y=-1,x-z=0$与$y=1,x-z=0$，也全部位于曲面。", "第四步:两平面的法向量在任何非零参数对下独立，故每个成员确为直线。", "第五步:矩阵$\\begin{pmatrix}x+z&1+y\\\\1-y&x-z\\end{pmatrix}$在曲面上秩为$1$且不可能为零；其列空间和行空间分别唯一确定两族参数，故每点各有一条母线。"]}, "source": "self-authored", "license": "Internal-Research-Use-Only", "draft_status": "CODEX-REPAIR-v4-final-NOT-ADMITTED", "review_status": "CODEX_MATH_REVIEW_COMPLETE_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE", "versioned_id": "codex-repair-v4-final-20261005-batch-11-draft-c22-01", "admitted": false, "animation_render_verified": false, "strict_review": {"core_math_verified": true, "exact_expression_required": true, "rational_numbers": "fractions_or_integers", "text_math_fields_reviewed": true, "scene_text_reviewed": true, "render_verified": false, "admitted": false, "source_batch": "batch-11", "source_sha256": "e0eb9bf14b1cdf0919006ede0e9523046d0edadffb69ac3a10e4941a77563756", "user_review_new_version": "DELEGATED_TO_CODEX_COMPLETED", "math_content_sha256": "be7ab9e1d87346f308f6db686c9cd39fd20755b71fb609038de46a1211aecb23", "math_review_evidence": "reviews/codex-supervision/2026-10-05-draft-mail-reverification/selected-math-review-final.json", "verification_basis": "HASH_BOUND_PRIOR_MATH_PLUS_EQUIVALENT_NOTATION_AND_SCENE_REVIEW_EXACT_41_CHECKS"}, "revision_lineage": {"source_sha256": "e0eb9bf14b1cdf0919006ede0e9523046d0edadffb69ac3a10e4941a77563756", "source_path": "reviews/2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts/batch-11/draft.jsonl", "original_id": "draft-c22-01", "prior_parent_training_ids": ["geom-028"], "historical_risk_not_reset": true, "version": "codex-repair-v4-final", "math_correction_notes": "使用齐次参数，不除以可能为零的参数，补全无穷远两条母线。", "substantive_rewrite": false, "previous_selected_version": {"version": "codex-repair-v3", "path": "reviews/2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts/batch-11/draft-codex-repair-v3.jsonl", "sha256": "37f23ea69c81a0d0c7e15c195d365c71408f4b081e8ae06b2806d1662609e106", "versioned_id": "codex-repair-20261005-batch-11-draft-c22-01"}, "previous_math_review_binding": {"math_content_sha256": null, "evidence": null}}}
{"id": "draft-c22-02", "category": "解析几何", "sub_category": "二次曲面", "concept": "直纹性与母线", "concept_id": "C22", "parent_training_ids": ["geom-028"], "problem": "证明球面 $x^2+y^2+z^2=1$ 不是直纹面。", "solution": "任一直线与球面至多有两个交点:设直线 $l(t)=p+td$($d\\neq0$),代入球面方程得 $(p_1+td_1)^2+(p_2+td_2)^2+(p_3+td_3)^2=1$,即 $|d|^2t^2+2(p\\cdot d)t+(|p|^2-1)=0$。因二次项系数 $|d|^2>0$,这是真正的二次方程,至多有两个实根;该二次多项式不可能恒为零(二次项系数非零)。故球面不含任何整条直线,即球面上不存在母线,球面不是直纹面。", "answer": "球面不是直纹面:任一直线与球面至多交于两点,球面不含整条直线。", "method": "交点个数论证(反证)", "difficulty": "基础", "variant_kind": "证否:球面非直纹的二次方程交点论证", "scene_spec": {"objects": ["证明球面 $x^2+y^2+z^2=1$ 不是直纹面。", "球面不是直纹面:任一直线与球面至多交于两点,球面不含整条直线。"], "steps": ["第一步:任一直线与球面至多有两个交点:设直线 $l(t)=p+td$($d\\neq0$),代入球面方程得 $(p_1+td_1)^2+(p_2+td_2)^2+(p_3+td_3)^2=1$,即 $|d|^2t^2+2(p\\cdot d)t+(|p|^2-1)=0$。", "第二步:因二次项系数 $|d|^2>0$,这是真正的二次方程,至多有两个实根;该二次多项式不可能恒为零(二次项系数非零)。", "第三步:故球面不含任何整条直线,即球面上不存在母线,球面不是直纹面。"]}, "source": "self-authored", "license": "Internal-Research-Use-Only", "draft_status": "CODEX-REPAIR-v4-final-NOT-ADMITTED", "review_status": "CODEX_MATH_REVIEW_COMPLETE_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE", "versioned_id": "codex-repair-v4-final-20261005-batch-11-draft-c22-02", "admitted": false, "animation_render_verified": false, "strict_review": {"core_math_verified": true, "exact_expression_required": true, "rational_numbers": "fractions_or_integers", "text_math_fields_reviewed": true, "scene_text_reviewed": true, "render_verified": false, "admitted": false, "source_batch": "batch-11", "source_sha256": "e0eb9bf14b1cdf0919006ede0e9523046d0edadffb69ac3a10e4941a77563756", "user_review_new_version": "DELEGATED_TO_CODEX_COMPLETED", "math_content_sha256": "bd115127f671b55cf25a4a36ffde757caf1c8d10cb8523e0723d7b8d5ac4c19e", "math_review_evidence": "reviews/codex-supervision/2026-10-05-draft-mail-reverification/selected-math-review-final.json", "verification_basis": "HASH_BOUND_PRIOR_MATH_PLUS_EQUIVALENT_NOTATION_AND_SCENE_REVIEW_EXACT_41_CHECKS"}, "revision_lineage": {"source_sha256": "e0eb9bf14b1cdf0919006ede0e9523046d0edadffb69ac3a10e4941a77563756", "source_path": "reviews/2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts/batch-11/draft.jsonl", "original_id": "draft-c22-02", "prior_parent_training_ids": ["geom-028"], "historical_risk_not_reset": true, "version": "codex-repair-v4-final", "math_correction_notes": "非零方向保证二次项正，整条线不能恒满足；这是普遍定号证明，不给冻结具体交点。", "substantive_rewrite": false, "previous_selected_version": {"version": "codex-repair-v3", "path": "reviews/2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts/batch-11/draft-codex-repair-v3.jsonl", "sha256": "37f23ea69c81a0d0c7e15c195d365c71408f4b081e8ae06b2806d1662609e106", "versioned_id": "codex-repair-20261005-batch-11-draft-c22-02"}, "previous_math_review_binding": {"math_content_sha256": null, "evidence": null}}}
{"id": "draft-c22-03", "category": "解析几何", "sub_category": "二次曲面", "concept": "直纹性与母线", "concept_id": "C22", "parent_training_ids": ["geom-028"], "problem": "求三次曲面$z=xy^2$上全部实直线，并判断每个点通过几条母线。", "solution": "设$p=(x_0,y_0,x_0y_0^2)$，方向$d=(a,b,c)\\ne0$，将$p+td$代入。比较$t^3,t^2,t$系数得$ab^2=0$、$2ay_0b+x_0b^2=0$、$c=ay_0^2+2x_0y_0b$。若$b=0$，则$c=ay_0^2$且$a\\ne0$，得到全部固定$y=v$的直线$(u,v,uv^2)$。若$b\\ne0$，第一式给$a=0$，第二式给$x_0=0$，第三式给$c=0$，仅得到$y$轴$(0,u,0)$。前述直线全都满足曲面，故无遗漏。$x\\ne0$的点只过一条固定$y$母线；$x=0$的曲面点同时过该母线和$y$轴，恰有两条。", "answer": "全部直线为$(u,v,uv^2)$（$v$固定）及$(0,u,0)$；$x\\ne0$过一条，$x=0$过两条。", "method": "直线恒等式的三次系数分类", "difficulty": "中等", "variant_kind": "结构改写：直线恒等式的三次系数分类", "scene_spec": {"objects": ["求三次曲面$z=xy^2$上全部实直线，并判断每个点通过几条母线。", "全部直线为$(u,v,uv^2)$（$v$固定）及$(0,u,0)$；$x\\ne0$过一条，$x=0$过两条。"], "steps": ["第一步:设$p=(x_0,y_0,x_0y_0^2)$，方向$d=(a,b,c)\\ne0$，将$p+td$代入。", "第二步:比较$t^3,t^2,t$系数得$ab^2=0$、$2ay_0b+x_0b^2=0$、$c=ay_0^2+2x_0y_0b$。", "第三步:若$b=0$，则$c=ay_0^2$且$a\\ne0$，得到全部固定$y=v$的直线$(u,v,uv^2)$。", "第四步:若$b\\ne0$，第一式给$a=0$，第二式给$x_0=0$，第三式给$c=0$，仅得到$y$轴$(0,u,0)$。", "第五步:前述直线全都满足曲面，故无遗漏。", "第六步:$x\\ne0$的点只过一条固定$y$母线；$x=0$的曲面点同时过该母线和$y$轴，恰有两条。"]}, "source": "self-authored", "license": "Internal-Research-Use-Only", "draft_status": "CODEX-REPAIR-v4-final-NOT-ADMITTED", "review_status": "CODEX_MATH_REVIEW_COMPLETE_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE", "versioned_id": "codex-repair-v4-final-20261005-batch-11-draft-c22-03", "admitted": false, "animation_render_verified": false, "strict_review": {"core_math_verified": true, "exact_expression_required": true, "rational_numbers": "fractions_or_integers", "text_math_fields_reviewed": true, "scene_text_reviewed": true, "render_verified": false, "admitted": false, "source_batch": "batch-11", "source_sha256": "e0eb9bf14b1cdf0919006ede0e9523046d0edadffb69ac3a10e4941a77563756", "user_review_new_version": "DELEGATED_TO_CODEX_COMPLETED", "math_content_sha256": "9994839025b0936cd5ce83ccdb2fb16371c1b153b78189736a9f00c7191c84f7", "math_review_evidence": "reviews/codex-supervision/2026-10-05-draft-mail-reverification/selected-math-review-final.json", "verification_basis": "HASH_BOUND_PRIOR_MATH_PLUS_EQUIVALENT_NOTATION_AND_SCENE_REVIEW_EXACT_41_CHECKS"}, "revision_lineage": {"source_sha256": "e0eb9bf14b1cdf0919006ede0e9523046d0edadffb69ac3a10e4941a77563756", "source_path": "reviews/2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts/batch-11/draft.jsonl", "original_id": "draft-c22-03", "prior_parent_training_ids": ["geom-028"], "historical_risk_not_reset": true, "version": "codex-repair-v4-final", "math_correction_notes": "替换留出集完全相同的双线性抛物面母线任务，改为三次曲面及例外母线。", "substantive_rewrite": true, "previous_selected_version": {"version": "codex-repair-v3", "path": "reviews/2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts/batch-11/draft-codex-repair-v3.jsonl", "sha256": "37f23ea69c81a0d0c7e15c195d365c71408f4b081e8ae06b2806d1662609e106", "versioned_id": "codex-repair-20261005-batch-11-draft-c22-03"}, "previous_math_review_binding": {"math_content_sha256": null, "evidence": null}}}
{"id": "draft-c22-04", "category": "解析几何", "sub_category": "二次曲面", "concept": "直纹性与母线", "concept_id": "C22", "parent_training_ids": ["geom-028"], "problem": "设实二次曲面$F(x)=x^{\\mathsf T}Ax+2b^{\\mathsf T}x+c=0$，$A=A^{\\mathsf T}$。证明$p+td$（$d\\ne0$）整条直线在曲面上的充要条件，并据此说明正定或负定$A$为何不允许母线。", "solution": "精确展开$F(p+td)=F(p)+2t(Ap+b)^{\\mathsf T}d+t^2d^{\\mathsf T}Ad$。它对所有实$t$为零，当且仅当三个系数全为零，即$F(p)=0$、$(Ap+b)^{\\mathsf T}d=0$、$d^{\\mathsf T}Ad=0$。充分性由代回恒等式立即成立。若$A$正定或负定，对$d\\ne0$均有$d^{\\mathsf T}Ad\\ne0$，故没有整条母线；半定或不定时还必须核对点与混合项条件，存在零二次值方向本身并不充分。", "answer": "$F(p)=0$、$(Ap+b)^{\\mathsf T}d=0$、$d^{\\mathsf T}Ad=0$三条件充要；定号型没有母线。", "method": "一般仿射二次曲面的母线判据", "difficulty": "中等", "variant_kind": "结构改写：一般仿射二次曲面的母线判据", "scene_spec": {"objects": ["设实二次曲面$F(x)=x^{\\mathsf T}Ax+2b^{\\mathsf T}x+c=0$，$A=A^{\\mathsf T}$。证明$p+td$（$d\\ne0$）整条直线在曲面上的充要条件，并据此说明正定或负定$A$为何不允许母线。", "$F(p)=0$、$(Ap+b)^{\\mathsf T}d=0$、$d^{\\mathsf T}Ad=0$三条件充要；定号型没有母线。"], "steps": ["第一步:精确展开$F(p+td)=F(p)+2t(Ap+b)^{\\mathsf T}d+t^2d^{\\mathsf T}Ad$。", "第二步:它对所有实$t$为零，当且仅当三个系数全为零，即$F(p)=0$、$(Ap+b)^{\\mathsf T}d=0$、$d^{\\mathsf T}Ad=0$。", "第三步:充分性由代回恒等式立即成立。", "第四步:若$A$正定或负定，对$d\\ne0$均有$d^{\\mathsf T}Ad\\ne0$，故没有整条母线；半定或不定时还必须核对点与混合项条件，存在零二次值方向本身并不充分。"]}, "source": "self-authored", "license": "Internal-Research-Use-Only", "draft_status": "CODEX-REPAIR-v4-final-NOT-ADMITTED", "review_status": "CODEX_MATH_REVIEW_COMPLETE_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE", "versioned_id": "codex-repair-v4-final-20261005-batch-11-draft-c22-04", "admitted": false, "animation_render_verified": false, "strict_review": {"core_math_verified": true, "exact_expression_required": true, "rational_numbers": "fractions_or_integers", "text_math_fields_reviewed": true, "scene_text_reviewed": true, "render_verified": false, "admitted": false, "source_batch": "batch-11", "source_sha256": "e0eb9bf14b1cdf0919006ede0e9523046d0edadffb69ac3a10e4941a77563756", "user_review_new_version": "DELEGATED_TO_CODEX_COMPLETED", "math_content_sha256": "027521129ca46703ff323589170756ac60f3df8a7f4eeb2b3c0eb93b2dcbdd9f", "math_review_evidence": "reviews/codex-supervision/2026-10-05-draft-mail-reverification/selected-math-review-final.json", "verification_basis": "HASH_BOUND_PRIOR_MATH_PLUS_EQUIVALENT_NOTATION_AND_SCENE_REVIEW_EXACT_41_CHECKS"}, "revision_lineage": {"source_sha256": "e0eb9bf14b1cdf0919006ede0e9523046d0edadffb69ac3a10e4941a77563756", "source_path": "reviews/2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts/batch-11/draft.jsonl", "original_id": "draft-c22-04", "prior_parent_training_ids": ["geom-028"], "historical_risk_not_reset": true, "version": "codex-repair-v4-final", "math_correction_notes": "替换多个已重复的具体曲面结论，改为含一次项的完整母线判据。", "substantive_rewrite": true, "previous_selected_version": {"version": "codex-repair-v3", "path": "reviews/2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts/batch-11/draft-codex-repair-v3.jsonl", "sha256": "37f23ea69c81a0d0c7e15c195d365c71408f4b081e8ae06b2806d1662609e106", "versioned_id": "codex-repair-20261005-batch-11-draft-c22-04"}, "previous_math_review_binding": {"math_content_sha256": null, "evidence": null}}}
{"id": "draft-c22-05", "category": "解析几何", "sub_category": "二次曲面", "concept": "直纹性与母线", "concept_id": "C22", "parent_training_ids": ["geom-028"], "problem": "证明双叶双曲面 $x^2+y^2-z^2=-1$ 不是直纹面。", "solution": "若双叶双曲面$x^2+y^2-z^2=-1$含直线$p+td$，$d\\ne0$，比较系数有$p_1^2+p_2^2=p_3^2-1$、$d_1^2+d_2^2=d_3^2$及$p_1d_1+p_2d_2=p_3d_3$。若$d_3=0$，则$d_1=d_2=0$矛盾，故$d_3^2>0$。由Cauchy不等式，$(p_3d_3)^2\\le(p_3^2-1)d_3^2<p_3^2d_3^2$，矛盾。因此不存在母线。", "answer": "双叶双曲面不是直纹面:假设整条直线在曲面上,多项式恒零给出三个系数方程,由柯西不等式导出 $|p_3d_3|<|p_3d_3|$ 的矛盾(证明见解法)。", "method": "多项式系数分析+柯西不等式(反证)", "difficulty": "进阶", "variant_kind": "证明型:非直纹面的严格反证证明(多项式恒零+不等式矛盾)", "scene_spec": {"objects": ["证明双叶双曲面 $x^2+y^2-z^2=-1$ 不是直纹面。", "双叶双曲面不是直纹面:假设整条直线在曲面上,多项式恒零给出三个系数方程,由柯西不等式导出 $|p_3d_3|<|p_3d_3|$ 的矛盾(证明见解法)。"], "steps": ["第一步:若双叶双曲面$x^2+y^2-z^2=-1$含直线$p+td$，$d\\ne0$，比较系数有$p_1^2+p_2^2=p_3^2-1$、$d_1^2+d_2^2=d_3^2$及$p_1d_1+p_2d_2=p_3d_3$。", "第二步:若$d_3=0$，则$d_1=d_2=0$矛盾，故$d_3^2>0$。", "第三步:由Cauchy不等式，$(p_3d_3)^2\\le(p_3^2-1)d_3^2<p_3^2d_3^2$，矛盾。", "第四步:因此不存在母线。"]}, "source": "self-authored", "license": "Internal-Research-Use-Only", "draft_status": "CODEX-REPAIR-v4-final-NOT-ADMITTED", "review_status": "CODEX_MATH_REVIEW_COMPLETE_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE", "versioned_id": "codex-repair-v4-final-20261005-batch-11-draft-c22-05", "admitted": false, "animation_render_verified": false, "strict_review": {"core_math_verified": true, "exact_expression_required": true, "rational_numbers": "fractions_or_integers", "text_math_fields_reviewed": true, "scene_text_reviewed": true, "render_verified": false, "admitted": false, "source_batch": "batch-11", "source_sha256": "e0eb9bf14b1cdf0919006ede0e9523046d0edadffb69ac3a10e4941a77563756", "user_review_new_version": "DELEGATED_TO_CODEX_COMPLETED", "math_content_sha256": "3fa1364b12f617758f00bede6ff4cf63ef495458e7322a9f6f23d48f25d0f1bc", "math_review_evidence": "reviews/codex-supervision/2026-10-05-draft-mail-reverification/selected-math-review-final.json", "verification_basis": "HASH_BOUND_PRIOR_MATH_PLUS_EQUIVALENT_NOTATION_AND_SCENE_REVIEW_EXACT_41_CHECKS"}, "revision_lineage": {"source_sha256": "e0eb9bf14b1cdf0919006ede0e9523046d0edadffb69ac3a10e4941a77563756", "source_path": "reviews/2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts/batch-11/draft.jsonl", "original_id": "draft-c22-05", "prior_parent_training_ids": ["geom-028"], "historical_risk_not_reset": true, "version": "codex-repair-v4-final", "math_correction_notes": "补上非零方向及纵向分量不能为零的论证。", "substantive_rewrite": false, "previous_selected_version": {"version": "codex-repair-v3", "path": "reviews/2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts/batch-11/draft-codex-repair-v3.jsonl", "sha256": "37f23ea69c81a0d0c7e15c195d365c71408f4b081e8ae06b2806d1662609e106", "versioned_id": "codex-repair-20261005-batch-11-draft-c22-05"}, "previous_math_review_binding": {"math_content_sha256": null, "evidence": null}}}
{"id": "draft-c23-01", "category": "解析几何", "sub_category": "空间变换", "concept": "等距变换", "concept_id": "C23", "parent_training_ids": ["geom-029"], "problem": "求等距变换 $T(x)=Ax+b$ 的逆变换，其中 $A=\\begin{pmatrix}0&1&0\\\\-1&0&0\\\\0&0&1\\end{pmatrix}$，$b=(1,2,3)$。", "solution": "$A$ 为正交矩阵,逆变换为 $T^{-1}(x)=A^{\\mathsf T}x-A^{\\mathsf T}b$。$A^{\\mathsf T}=\\begin{pmatrix}0&-1&0\\\\1&0&0\\\\0&0&1\\end{pmatrix}$,$A^{\\mathsf T}b=(0-2,\\ 1+0,\\ 0+3)=(-2,1,3)$。故 $T^{-1}(x)=A^{\\mathsf T}x-(-2,1,3)=A^{\\mathsf T}x+(2,-1,-3)$。验证:$T(T^{-1}(x))=A(A^{\\mathsf T}x-A^{\\mathsf T}b)+b=x-b+b=x$ ✓。", "answer": "$T^{-1}(x)=A^{\\mathsf T}x+(2,-1,-3)$,即 $T^{-1}(x,y,z)=(-y+2,\\,x-1,\\,z-3)$。", "method": "正交矩阵的逆变换公式", "difficulty": "基础", "variant_kind": "逆变换:等距变换的逆公式推导与验证", "scene_spec": {"objects": ["求等距变换 $T(x)=Ax+b$ 的逆变换，其中 $A=\\begin{pmatrix}0&1&0\\\\-1&0&0\\\\0&0&1\\end{pmatrix}$，$b=(1,2,3)$。", "$T^{-1}(x)=A^{\\mathsf T}x+(2,-1,-3)$,即 $T^{-1}(x,y,z)=(-y+2,\\,x-1,\\,z-3)$。"], "steps": ["第一步:$A$ 为正交矩阵,逆变换为 $T^{-1}(x)=A^{\\mathsf T}x-A^{\\mathsf T}b$。", "第二步:$A^{\\mathsf T}=\\begin{pmatrix}0&-1&0\\\\1&0&0\\\\0&0&1\\end{pmatrix}$,$A^{\\mathsf T}b=(0-2,\\ 1+0,\\ 0+3)=(-2,1,3)$。", "第三步:故 $T^{-1}(x)=A^{\\mathsf T}x-(-2,1,3)=A^{\\mathsf T}x+(2,-1,-3)$。", "第四步:验证:$T(T^{-1}(x))=A(A^{\\mathsf T}x-A^{\\mathsf T}b)+b=x-b+b=x$ ✓。"]}, "source": "self-authored", "license": "Internal-Research-Use-Only", "draft_status": "CODEX-REPAIR-v4-final-NOT-ADMITTED", "review_status": "CODEX_MATH_REVIEW_COMPLETE_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE", "versioned_id": "codex-repair-v4-final-20261005-batch-11-draft-c23-01", "admitted": false, "animation_render_verified": false, "strict_review": {"core_math_verified": true, "exact_expression_required": true, "rational_numbers": "fractions_or_integers", "text_math_fields_reviewed": true, "scene_text_reviewed": true, "render_verified": false, "admitted": false, "source_batch": "batch-11", "source_sha256": "e0eb9bf14b1cdf0919006ede0e9523046d0edadffb69ac3a10e4941a77563756", "user_review_new_version": "DELEGATED_TO_CODEX_COMPLETED", "math_content_sha256": "e94980d78cf598ba601617a83ff03aee559bdfe52f3e520c53cfbe9ee947191f", "math_review_evidence": "reviews/codex-supervision/2026-10-05-draft-mail-reverification/selected-math-review-final.json", "verification_basis": "HASH_BOUND_PRIOR_MATH_PLUS_EQUIVALENT_NOTATION_AND_SCENE_REVIEW_EXACT_41_CHECKS"}, "revision_lineage": {"source_sha256": "e0eb9bf14b1cdf0919006ede0e9523046d0edadffb69ac3a10e4941a77563756", "source_path": "reviews/2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts/batch-11/draft.jsonl", "original_id": "draft-c23-01", "prior_parent_training_ids": ["geom-029"], "historical_risk_not_reset": true, "version": "codex-repair-v4-final", "math_correction_notes": "双侧仿射逆通过AᵀA=I与平移校正，Aᵀb=(-2,1,3)正确。", "substantive_rewrite": false, "previous_selected_version": {"version": "codex-repair-v3", "path": "reviews/2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts/batch-11/draft-codex-repair-v3.jsonl", "sha256": "37f23ea69c81a0d0c7e15c195d365c71408f4b081e8ae06b2806d1662609e106", "versioned_id": "codex-repair-20261005-batch-11-draft-c23-01"}, "previous_math_review_binding": {"math_content_sha256": null, "evidence": null}}}
{"id": "draft-c23-02", "category": "解析几何", "sub_category": "空间变换", "concept": "等距变换", "concept_id": "C23", "parent_training_ids": ["geom-029"], "problem": "证明:若 $A$ 为正交矩阵,则等距变换 $T(x)=Ax+b$ 保持任意两点间的距离,即 $\\|T(x)-T(y)\\|=\\|x-y\\|$。", "solution": "$\\|T(x)-T(y)\\|=\\|(Ax+b)-(Ay+b)\\|=\\|A(x-y)\\|$。由正交矩阵的性质 $\\|Au\\|^2=(Au)^{\\mathsf T}(Au)=u^{\\mathsf T}A^{\\mathsf T}Au=u^{\\mathsf T}u=\\|u\\|^2$,故 $\\|A(x-y)\\|=\\|x-y\\|$,距离保持不变。", "answer": "证明见解法(核心:$\\|Au\\|^2=u^{\\mathsf T}A^{\\mathsf T}Au=u^{\\mathsf T}u$)。", "method": "正交矩阵保范数证明", "difficulty": "基础", "variant_kind": "保持量:等距变换保距离的证明", "scene_spec": {"objects": ["证明:若 $A$ 为正交矩阵,则等距变换 $T(x)=Ax+b$ 保持任意两点间的距离,即 $\\|T(x)-T(y)\\|=\\|x-y\\|$。", "证明见解法(核心:$\\|Au\\|^2=u^{\\mathsf T}A^{\\mathsf T}Au=u^{\\mathsf T}u$)。"], "steps": ["第一步:$\\|T(x)-T(y)\\|=\\|(Ax+b)-(Ay+b)\\|=\\|A(x-y)\\|$。", "第二步:由正交矩阵的性质 $\\|Au\\|^2=(Au)^{\\mathsf T}(Au)=u^{\\mathsf T}A^{\\mathsf T}Au=u^{\\mathsf T}u=\\|u\\|^2$,故 $\\|A(x-y)\\|=\\|x-y\\|$,距离保持不变。"]}, "source": "self-authored", "license": "Internal-Research-Use-Only", "draft_status": "CODEX-REPAIR-v4-final-NOT-ADMITTED", "review_status": "CODEX_MATH_REVIEW_COMPLETE_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE", "versioned_id": "codex-repair-v4-final-20261005-batch-11-draft-c23-02", "admitted": false, "animation_render_verified": false, "strict_review": {"core_math_verified": true, "exact_expression_required": true, "rational_numbers": "fractions_or_integers", "text_math_fields_reviewed": true, "scene_text_reviewed": true, "render_verified": false, "admitted": false, "source_batch": "batch-11", "source_sha256": "e0eb9bf14b1cdf0919006ede0e9523046d0edadffb69ac3a10e4941a77563756", "user_review_new_version": "DELEGATED_TO_CODEX_COMPLETED", "math_content_sha256": "07d55c1b08c1c970e96bde227d5e84338ec3d0e8f3789632807cb73ae8497a0e", "math_review_evidence": "reviews/codex-supervision/2026-10-05-draft-mail-reverification/selected-math-review-final.json", "verification_basis": "HASH_BOUND_PRIOR_MATH_PLUS_EQUIVALENT_NOTATION_AND_SCENE_REVIEW_EXACT_41_CHECKS"}, "revision_lineage": {"source_sha256": "e0eb9bf14b1cdf0919006ede0e9523046d0edadffb69ac3a10e4941a77563756", "source_path": "reviews/2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts/batch-11/draft.jsonl", "original_id": "draft-c23-02", "prior_parent_training_ids": ["geom-029"], "historical_risk_not_reset": true, "version": "codex-repair-v4-final", "math_correction_notes": "任意两点差消平移，范数二次式由AᵀA=I保持；普遍定理无冻结数值实例。", "substantive_rewrite": false, "previous_selected_version": {"version": "codex-repair-v3", "path": "reviews/2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts/batch-11/draft-codex-repair-v3.jsonl", "sha256": "37f23ea69c81a0d0c7e15c195d365c71408f4b081e8ae06b2806d1662609e106", "versioned_id": "codex-repair-20261005-batch-11-draft-c23-02"}, "previous_math_review_binding": {"math_content_sha256": null, "evidence": null}}}
{"id": "draft-c23-03", "category": "解析几何", "sub_category": "空间变换", "concept": "等距变换", "concept_id": "C23", "parent_training_ids": ["geom-029"], "problem": "分析等距变换$T(x,y,z)=(x+2,4-y,z)$：说明其几何类型，求固定点集合、逆变换及$T^2$，并证明它保持距离。", "solution": "线性部分$A=\\operatorname{diag}(1,-1,1)$满足$A^{\\mathsf T}A=I$，故两点之差的长度保持。$T$是关于$y=2$的反射，再沿该平面平移$(2,0,0)$，为滑移反射。固定点需$x+2=x$，不可能，故固定点集合为空。反解得$T^{-1}(u,v,w)=(u-2,4-v,w)$，复合得$T^2(x,y,z)=(x+4,y,z)$。它虽反转定向，却不是具有固定平面的单纯反射。", "answer": "滑移反射，无固定点；$T^{-1}=(x-2,4-y,z)$，$T^2=(x+4,y,z)$，保持距离。", "method": "滑移反射的仿射结构", "difficulty": "中等", "variant_kind": "结构改写：滑移反射的仿射结构", "scene_spec": {"objects": ["分析等距变换$T(x,y,z)=(x+2,4-y,z)$：说明其几何类型，求固定点集合、逆变换及$T^2$，并证明它保持距离。", "滑移反射，无固定点；$T^{-1}=(x-2,4-y,z)$，$T^2=(x+4,y,z)$，保持距离。"], "steps": ["第一步:线性部分$A=\\operatorname{diag}(1,-1,1)$满足$A^{\\mathsf T}A=I$，故两点之差的长度保持。", "第二步:$T$是关于$y=2$的反射，再沿该平面平移$(2,0,0)$，为滑移反射。", "第三步:固定点需$x+2=x$，不可能，故固定点集合为空。", "第四步:反解得$T^{-1}(u,v,w)=(u-2,4-v,w)$，复合得$T^2(x,y,z)=(x+4,y,z)$。", "第五步:它虽反转定向，却不是具有固定平面的单纯反射。"]}, "source": "self-authored", "license": "Internal-Research-Use-Only", "draft_status": "CODEX-REPAIR-v4-final-NOT-ADMITTED", "review_status": "CODEX_MATH_REVIEW_COMPLETE_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE", "versioned_id": "codex-repair-v4-final-20261005-batch-11-draft-c23-03", "admitted": false, "animation_render_verified": false, "strict_review": {"core_math_verified": true, "exact_expression_required": true, "rational_numbers": "fractions_or_integers", "text_math_fields_reviewed": true, "scene_text_reviewed": true, "render_verified": false, "admitted": false, "source_batch": "batch-11", "source_sha256": "e0eb9bf14b1cdf0919006ede0e9523046d0edadffb69ac3a10e4941a77563756", "user_review_new_version": "DELEGATED_TO_CODEX_COMPLETED", "math_content_sha256": "59f561330f9b4ab456e40aec0d9aadc0a7f6abbb01a6169a47d25690074dc530", "math_review_evidence": "reviews/codex-supervision/2026-10-05-draft-mail-reverification/selected-math-review-final.json", "verification_basis": "HASH_BOUND_PRIOR_MATH_PLUS_EQUIVALENT_NOTATION_AND_SCENE_REVIEW_EXACT_41_CHECKS"}, "revision_lineage": {"source_sha256": "e0eb9bf14b1cdf0919006ede0e9523046d0edadffb69ac3a10e4941a77563756", "source_path": "reviews/2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts/batch-11/draft.jsonl", "original_id": "draft-c23-03", "prior_parent_training_ids": ["geom-029"], "historical_risk_not_reset": true, "version": "codex-repair-v4-final", "math_correction_notes": "替换留出集同一坐标轴旋转的特例，改为无固定点的反定向等距变换。", "substantive_rewrite": true, "previous_selected_version": {"version": "codex-repair-v3", "path": "reviews/2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts/batch-11/draft-codex-repair-v3.jsonl", "sha256": "37f23ea69c81a0d0c7e15c195d365c71408f4b081e8ae06b2806d1662609e106", "versioned_id": "codex-repair-20261005-batch-11-draft-c23-03"}, "previous_math_review_binding": {"math_content_sha256": null, "evidence": null}}}
{"id": "draft-c23-04", "category": "解析几何", "sub_category": "空间变换", "concept": "等距变换", "concept_id": "C23", "parent_training_ids": ["geom-029"], "problem": "取单位法向量$n=(2,-1,2)/3$，两平面$n\\cdot x=1$、$n\\cdot x=5/2$。求先关于前者、再关于后者反射的复合，说明逆序、固定点和两平面间距。", "solution": "记$R_a(x)=x-2(n\\cdot x-a)n$，因$\\|n\\|=1$，$n\\cdot R_a(x)=2a-n\\cdot x$。所以$R_bR_a(x)=x+2(b-a)n$。代入$a=1,b=5/2$，复合为$x+(2,-1,2)$，是非零平移，故没有固定点；逆序为$x-(2,-1,2)$，正是逆变换。单位法向量使平面距离等于$|b-a|=3/2$，平移距离为$3$。", "answer": "复合$x\\mapsto x+(2,-1,2)$；逆序反向平移，无固定点，平面间距$3/2$。", "method": "平行反射复合为平移", "difficulty": "中等", "variant_kind": "结构改写：平行反射复合为平移", "scene_spec": {"objects": ["取单位法向量$n=(2,-1,2)/3$，两平面$n\\cdot x=1$、$n\\cdot x=5/2$。求先关于前者、再关于后者反射的复合，说明逆序、固定点和两平面间距。", "复合$x\\mapsto x+(2,-1,2)$；逆序反向平移，无固定点，平面间距$3/2$。"], "steps": ["第一步:记$R_a(x)=x-2(n\\cdot x-a)n$，因$\\|n\\|=1$，$n\\cdot R_a(x)=2a-n\\cdot x$。", "第二步:所以$R_bR_a(x)=x+2(b-a)n$。", "第三步:代入$a=1,b=5/2$，复合为$x+(2,-1,2)$，是非零平移，故没有固定点；逆序为$x-(2,-1,2)$，正是逆变换。", "第四步:单位法向量使平面距离等于$|b-a|=3/2$，平移距离为$3$。"]}, "source": "self-authored", "license": "Internal-Research-Use-Only", "draft_status": "CODEX-REPAIR-v4-final-NOT-ADMITTED", "review_status": "CODEX_MATH_REVIEW_COMPLETE_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE", "versioned_id": "codex-repair-v4-final-20261005-batch-11-draft-c23-04", "admitted": false, "animation_render_verified": false, "strict_review": {"core_math_verified": true, "exact_expression_required": true, "rational_numbers": "fractions_or_integers", "text_math_fields_reviewed": true, "scene_text_reviewed": true, "render_verified": false, "admitted": false, "source_batch": "batch-11", "source_sha256": "e0eb9bf14b1cdf0919006ede0e9523046d0edadffb69ac3a10e4941a77563756", "user_review_new_version": "DELEGATED_TO_CODEX_COMPLETED", "math_content_sha256": "9c990871e2514c56fea83ac69f183c8ee7ef503895e4dd1b1750117737b8346e", "math_review_evidence": "reviews/codex-supervision/2026-10-05-draft-mail-reverification/selected-math-review-final.json", "verification_basis": "HASH_BOUND_PRIOR_MATH_PLUS_EQUIVALENT_NOTATION_AND_SCENE_REVIEW_EXACT_41_CHECKS"}, "revision_lineage": {"source_sha256": "e0eb9bf14b1cdf0919006ede0e9523046d0edadffb69ac3a10e4941a77563756", "source_path": "reviews/2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts/batch-11/draft.jsonl", "original_id": "draft-c23-04", "prior_parent_training_ids": ["geom-029"], "historical_risk_not_reset": true, "version": "codex-repair-v4-final", "math_correction_notes": "替换留出集相同平面的单次点反射，改为平行平面复合与顺序效应。", "substantive_rewrite": true, "previous_selected_version": {"version": "codex-repair-v3", "path": "reviews/2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts/batch-11/draft-codex-repair-v3.jsonl", "sha256": "37f23ea69c81a0d0c7e15c195d365c71408f4b081e8ae06b2806d1662609e106", "versioned_id": "codex-repair-20261005-batch-11-draft-c23-04"}, "previous_math_review_binding": {"math_content_sha256": null, "evidence": null}}}
{"id": "draft-c23-05", "category": "解析几何", "sub_category": "空间变换", "concept": "等距变换", "concept_id": "C23", "parent_training_ids": ["geom-029"], "problem": "把等距变换 $T(x)=Ax+b$ 分解为绕某轴的旋转与沿该轴平移的复合(螺旋运动),其中 $A=\\begin{pmatrix}0&-1&0\\\\1&0&0\\\\0&0&1\\end{pmatrix}$(绕 $z$ 轴旋转 $90^\\circ$),$b=(1,2,3)$。", "solution": "旋转轴方向 $v=(0,0,1)$。把 $b$ 分解为沿轴分量与垂直分量:$b_\\parallel=(b\\cdot v)v=(0,0,3)$,$b_\\perp=b-b_\\parallel=(1,2,0)$。在 $v^\\perp$ 上解 $(I-A)p=b_\\perp$:$I-A=\\begin{pmatrix}1&1&0\\\\-1&1&0\\\\0&0&0\\end{pmatrix}$,方程 $p_1+p_2=1$,$-p_1+p_2=2$,解得 $p_1=-\\frac12,p_2=\\frac32$;取 $p=(-\\frac12,\\frac32,0)$。则 $T(x)=A(x-p)+p+b_\\parallel$:验证右端 $=Ax+(I-A)p+(0,0,3)=Ax+(1,2,0)+(0,0,3)=Ax+b=T(x)$ ✓。故 $T$ 是「绕过点 $p$、平行于 $z$ 轴的直线旋转 $90^\\circ$」与「沿 $z$ 轴平移 $(0,0,3)$」的复合(螺旋运动)。", "answer": "$T=$ 绕过 $p=(-\\frac12,\\frac32,0)$ 且平行于 $z$ 轴的直线旋转 $90^\\circ$,复合沿 $z$ 轴平移 $(0,0,3)$。", "method": "螺旋运动分解(轴向/垂直分量分离)", "difficulty": "进阶", "variant_kind": "分解型:等距变换的螺旋运动分解与验证", "scene_spec": {"objects": ["把等距变换 $T(x)=Ax+b$ 分解为绕某轴的旋转与沿该轴平移的复合(螺旋运动),其中 $A=\\begin{pmatrix}0&-1&0\\\\1&0&0\\\\0&0&1\\end{pmatrix}$(绕 $z$ 轴旋转 $90^\\circ$),$b=(1,2,3)$。", "$T=$ 绕过 $p=(-\\frac12,\\frac32,0)$ 且平行于 $z$ 轴的直线旋转 $90^\\circ$,复合沿 $z$ 轴平移 $(0,0,3)$。"], "steps": ["第一步:旋转轴方向 $v=(0,0,1)$。", "第二步:把 $b$ 分解为沿轴分量与垂直分量:$b_\\parallel=(b\\cdot v)v=(0,0,3)$,$b_\\perp=b-b_\\parallel=(1,2,0)$。", "第三步:在 $v^\\perp$ 上解 $(I-A)p=b_\\perp$:$I-A=\\begin{pmatrix}1&1&0\\\\-1&1&0\\\\0&0&0\\end{pmatrix}$,方程 $p_1+p_2=1$,$-p_1+p_2=2$,解得 $p_1=-\\frac12,p_2=\\frac32$;取 $p=(-\\frac12,\\frac32,0)$。", "第四步:则 $T(x)=A(x-p)+p+b_\\parallel$:验证右端 $=Ax+(I-A)p+(0,0,3)=Ax+(1,2,0)+(0,0,3)=Ax+b=T(x)$ ✓。", "第五步:故 $T$ 是「绕过点 $p$、平行于 $z$ 轴的直线旋转 $90^\\circ$」与「沿 $z$ 轴平移 $(0,0,3)$」的复合(螺旋运动)。"]}, "source": "self-authored", "license": "Internal-Research-Use-Only", "draft_status": "CODEX-REPAIR-v4-final-NOT-ADMITTED", "review_status": "CODEX_MATH_REVIEW_COMPLETE_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE", "versioned_id": "codex-repair-v4-final-20261005-batch-11-draft-c23-05", "admitted": false, "animation_render_verified": false, "strict_review": {"core_math_verified": true, "exact_expression_required": true, "rational_numbers": "fractions_or_integers", "text_math_fields_reviewed": true, "scene_text_reviewed": true, "render_verified": false, "admitted": false, "source_batch": "batch-11", "source_sha256": "e0eb9bf14b1cdf0919006ede0e9523046d0edadffb69ac3a10e4941a77563756", "user_review_new_version": "DELEGATED_TO_CODEX_COMPLETED", "math_content_sha256": "ed42c27e47eb591653e6b261fd7ed14dbe89b5d086196667618f605466e39237", "math_review_evidence": "reviews/codex-supervision/2026-10-05-draft-mail-reverification/selected-math-review-final.json", "verification_basis": "HASH_BOUND_PRIOR_MATH_PLUS_EQUIVALENT_NOTATION_AND_SCENE_REVIEW_EXACT_41_CHECKS"}, "revision_lineage": {"source_sha256": "e0eb9bf14b1cdf0919006ede0e9523046d0edadffb69ac3a10e4941a77563756", "source_path": "reviews/2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts/batch-11/draft.jsonl", "original_id": "draft-c23-05", "prior_parent_training_ids": ["geom-029"], "historical_risk_not_reset": true, "version": "codex-repair-v4-final", "math_correction_notes": "解(I-A)p=(1,2,0)得(-1/2,3/2,0)，余平移(0,0,3)，复合恒等式成立。", "substantive_rewrite": false, "previous_selected_version": {"version": "codex-repair-v3", "path": "reviews/2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts/batch-11/draft-codex-repair-v3.jsonl", "sha256": "37f23ea69c81a0d0c7e15c195d365c71408f4b081e8ae06b2806d1662609e106", "versioned_id": "codex-repair-20261005-batch-11-draft-c23-05"}, "previous_math_review_binding": {"math_content_sha256": null, "evidence": null}}}
